    {
      "name": "disbursements (G2P)",
      "description": "G2P batches paid by a party of the logged-in DFSP (log in as sdkbank-user).\n\nFlow: create → validate → poll get until VALIDATED → check the items → approve → poll get until COMPLETED, PARTIALLY_COMPLETED or FAILED.\n\nIn BULK mode (the default, `mode` in the response) validate starts the SDK's /bulkTransactions: the SDK looks every payee up through the ALS, approve accepts the parties, and the hub then runs one bulk quote and one bulk transfer (bulk-api-adapter) per payee DFSP. In INDIVIDUAL mode the scheduler pays each item as its own transfer.\n\nThe payer is {{governmentMsisdn}}, the government customer that scripts/setup-sdk-adapter.sh creates (step 7).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "create disbursement",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{url}}/api/disbursements",
              "host": [
                "{{url}}"
              ],
              "path": [
                "api",
                "disbursements"
              ]
            },
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"from\": {\n    \"idType\": \"MSISDN\",\n    \"idValue\": \"{{governmentMsisdn}}\"\n  },\n  \"currency\": \"CVE\",\n  \"reference\": \"Subsidio outubro 2026\",\n  \"note\": \"postman test\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"to\": {\n        \"idType\": \"MSISDN\",\n        \"idValue\": \"{{payeeMsisdn}}\"\n      },\n      \"amount\": 250,\n      \"note\": \"beneficiary 1\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"to\": {\n        \"idType\": \"MSISDN\",\n        \"idValue\": \"2389999999\"\n      },\n      \"amount\": 10\n    }\n  ]\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "description": "Creates the batch (CREATED) and its items (PENDING). Rejected with 400 naming the line for a missing payee, a bad amount, a repeated payee or the payer as payee. The second item is an unknown MSISDN: validation marks it INVALID (3204) and it is not paid, so the batch ends PARTIALLY_COMPLETED."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code < 300) {",
                  "  const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set(\"disbursementId\", body.disbursementId);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "validate",
          "request": {
            "method": "PUT",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
