                "{{disbursementId}}",
                "validate"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Starts the payee lookups (VALIDATING); the batch is VALIDATED once every item is VALID or INVALID. BULK: sends POST /bulkTransactions to the payer's SDK, which reports the parties back; a BULK batch is validated only once (409 3100 after that). INDIVIDUAL: validating a VALIDATED batch again looks every payee up again."
          },
